ing $y=2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta .$ This gives\n\n| **$\\theta $** | $0$ | $\\frac{\\pi }{6}$ | $\\frac{\\pi }{3}$ | $\\frac{2\\pi }{3}$ | $\\pi $ | $\\frac{4\\pi }{3}$ | $\\frac{5\\pi }{3}$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $x$ | $2$ | $\\sqrt{3}$ | $1$ | $-1$ | $-2$ | $-1$ | $1$ |\n| $y$ | $0$ | $1$ | $\\sqrt{3}$ | $\\sqrt{3}$ | $0$ | $-\\sqrt{3}$ | $-\\sqrt{3}$ |\n\n$$\n\n$$\n\nPlotting these points, we obtain the following curve:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14073429/assets/47615688bf550384de29a5e7e480bdab699b8eee994e5e28052e4d043e2db503.png)" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14073429/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a8bf6720b70a127fff563e34563a58874890bfbd8e1f55c5ec6d04df123712c"} {"question" "q-16196" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14073429/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "c59abd7d6f673481b73098c3b0b57ad19b4515f7214a4c3759965303bb4b5ee6"} {"question" "q-16196" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14073429/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a8bf6720b70a127fff563e34563a58874890bfbd8e1f55c5ec6d04df123712c"} {"question" "q-16196" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["image" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14073429/assets/2733af9666ca54ca578eea56a5f05d5d8245df01f7aa1312e70610ae8a7beee7.png"] ["image" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14073429/assets/9e5fb2564eb1f5adb380d70e1a86925fa377f10cc653d98d73ba64bfb03de197.png"] ["image" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/140